6.4 Multiple Catch Blocks
អ្នកអាចប្រើច្រើន catch blocks ដើម្បីីចាប់យក exceptions ប្រភេទផ្សេងៗ។
ឧទាហរណ៍នៃ multiple catch blocks៖
try {
    int[] numbers = { 1, 2, 3 };
    Console.WriteLine(numbers[5]); // This will throw an IndexOutOfRange
} catch (IndexOutOfRangeException ex) {
    Console.WriteLine("Index error: " + ex.Message);
} catch (Exception ex) {
    Console.WriteLine("General error: " + ex.Message);
}
លទ្ធផល៖
Index error: Index was outside the bounds of the array.
